#: inc/designs.php:60
msgid "Classic"
msgstr ""

#: inc/designs.php:61
msgid "A photograph across the top with the search over it, and properties in an even grid. The arrangement most agencies use, done properly."
msgstr ""

#: inc/designs.php:67
msgid "Split"
msgstr ""

#: inc/designs.php:68
msgid "The photograph takes one half and the search sits on a solid panel in the other. Reads well on a wide screen and stacks cleanly on a phone."
msgstr ""

#: inc/designs.php:74
msgid "Showcase"
msgstr ""

#: inc/designs.php:75
msgid "Your best properties move behind the search, and the listings appear as pictures with the detail over them. For an agency whose stock is the selling point."
msgstr ""

#: inc/designs.php:81
msgid "Editorial"
msgstr ""

#: inc/designs.php:82
msgid "No hero photograph. A confident line of type, the search beneath it, and properties in a list with room to say something about each. Fast, and unlike everyone else."
msgstr ""

#: inc/designs.php:88
msgid "Gallery"
msgstr ""

#: inc/designs.php:89
msgid "A short hero and then straight into the properties, staggered so the pictures lead. Suits an agency with a lot of stock and good photography."
msgstr ""

#: inc/designs.php:95
msgid "Boutique"
msgstr ""

#: inc/designs.php:96
msgid "Split the other way, with more air around everything and fewer properties on the page. For a small number of expensive houses."
msgstr ""

#: inc/designs.php:120
msgid "Connect"
msgstr ""

#: inc/designs.php:121
msgid "A search panel running the full width of the photograph with the filters side by side, and cards that stack their badges. Built for a busy sales portfolio where Reserved, Reduced and Exclusive all matter."
msgstr ""

#: inc/designs.php:127
msgid "Discover"
msgstr ""

#: inc/designs.php:128
msgid "Opens with the places you cover and the kinds of property you sell, as pictures somebody can press. For an agency whose buyers are choosing a town before they choose a house."
msgstr ""

#: inc/designs.php:135
msgid "Estate"
msgstr ""

#: inc/designs.php:136
msgid "Dark and gold, with the telephone, WhatsApp and shortlist along the top and the regions you cover below the fold. The luxury end of this market, done without shouting."
msgstr ""

#: inc/designs.php:152
msgid "Blue, open and friendly. The safe choice, and a good one."
msgstr ""

